Description:
 libmakemkv - Shared library for MakeMKV.
 makemkv-bin - MakeMKV command-line tools.
 mmccextr   - Closed Caption extractor for MakeMKV.
 mmgplsrv   - MakeMKV GPL Server used for decrypting DVDs by MakeMKV CLI.
 reel       - DVD and Blu-ray ripping tool.
 reel-common - Common files for reel.
 reel-gtk   - GTK Frontend for makemkvcon written in Python.
 reel-qt    - Qt Frontend for makemkvcon written in Python.
Changes:
 reel (2026-03-15+git~364aff7) stable; urgency=low
 .
   * feat: add Qt frontend for makemkvcon and update GTK installation paths
   * refactor: migrate from PyQt6 to PyQt5 across the application for current LTS support on Debian/Ubuntu.
   * refactor: Qt version for Plasma/Ldqt desktops.
   * chore: remove outdated README.md files from src/core and src/gtk
   * chore: Move GTK version it src/gtk
   * fix: update website link and installation instructions for MakeMKV
   * refactor: update README.md
   * fix: update version to use the real full path.
   * fix: update version file path in get_version function
   * fix: update version file path in get_version function
   * fix: remove redundant suggestion for makemkv-bin in package control
   * feat: update suggests for makemkv-bin to include additional dependencies
   * fix: adjust formatting in Makefile for improved readability
   * feat: add src/makemkv/tmp/ to .gitignore to prevent temporary files from being tracked
   * feat: add installation of main.py for GTK integration
   * feat: remove unused icon files in various sizes
   * feat: add Makefile for build process and remove run.sh script
   * feat: update .gitignore to include additional directories and files for build process
   * feat: enhance debian/rules for improved build process and documentation
   * feat: add installation files for new components and update existing paths
   * feat: update copyright file to include additional files and licensing information
   * feat: update debian/control to enhance package dependencies and descriptions
   * chore: Moved makemkv into main source directory for easier management.
   * feat: Added common makemkv library and subtitle extraction sources.
   * fix: update .gitignore to include additional directories for build artifacts
